  "description": "zplCore.com print import: turns what a Windows label program prints (the EMF print job) into a zplCore label template – texts with font, size and alignment, lines, boxes, images and native barcodes, fields bound by comparing a data print with a placeholder print, optionally fine-tuned against a preview picture. Reads only print jobs, never the label program's files.",
